========================================================
FRONTIER TRADING COMPANY
Virtual Project Structure (NOT REAL FILES - SINGLE FILE BUILD)
========================================================

/index.html
  - Bootstrap + UI root + canvas-less DOM renderer
  - Contains all JS/CSS inline

CORE ARCHITECTURE (logical modules inside this file)

1. Game
   - Owns main loop
   - Routes UI state
   - Coordinates all systems

2. Player
   - Money
   - Cargo inventory
   - Wagon upgrades
   - Stats tracking

3. Town
   - Name
   - Supply/demand modifiers
   - Specialty goods

4. Economy
   - Global price generation
   - Daily fluctuation engine
   - Market recalculation

5. Market
   - Buy/sell operations
   - Validation (capacity, funds)
   - Pricing interface layer

6. EventSystem
   - Travel random events
   - Applies gameplay modifiers
   - Logs outcomes

7. UI (inside Game class methods)
   - Town view
   - Market view
   - Travel screen
   - Log panel
   - Stats panel

========================================================
SYSTEM INTERACTION FLOW

Game.start()
  → loads save (localStorage)
  → initializes towns + economy
  → renders UI

Each "day":
  Travel OR wait
  → EventSystem.rollEvent()
  → Economy.tickDay()
  → Town prices update
  → Save auto-writes

Player actions:
  Buy/Sell → Market validates → Player updates inventory → Economy reference prices used

========================================================
RESPONSIBILITY OWNERSHIP

Game:
  - state orchestration
  - UI rendering
  - persistence trigger

Player:
  - inventory + money
  - upgrades
  - constraints

Economy:
  - price simulation
  - global balancing

Town:
  - identity + modifiers

Market:
  - transaction logic only

EventSystem:
  - randomness + travel consequences

========================================================
